{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682380/extras/dc675c3bc21f30ab8933d45a1479c3d3.poster.avif?t=1759433096\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682380/extras/dc675c3bc21f30ab8933d45a1479c3d3.webm?t=1759433096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682380/extras/dc675c3bc21f30ab8933d45a1479c3d3.mp4?t=1759433096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE ULTIMATE DOOMSDAY SIMULATOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extinction Day lets you experiment with and combine multiple disasters in a variety of scenarios. From natural catastrophes to deadly diseases, full scale warfare, zombie invasions and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more than 12 unique disaster abilities, 20 scenarios, dozens of perks and 4 difficulty settings, it will keep you destroying humanity for many hours.<br><br><br><br>\u200b<strong>UNLEASH DESTRUCTION ON AN EPIC SCALE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our unique technology simulates over 80,000* humans simultaneously on screen as you deploy devastating plagues, natural catastrophes, global conflicts and more tragedies. Designed using real-world data for an authentic simulation of humanity\u2019s downfall.<i></i><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORE THAN JUST A 2D SIMULATION</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch disasters unfold in real-time, dynamically evolving and spreading based on your strategic choices. Combine different disasters to create chain reactions and watch civilization collapse before your eyes. Humanity won't go down without a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE WAYS TO END THE WORLD</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story-driven campaign with varied extinction scenarios, or test your strategic prowess in challenging game modes. With dozens of hours of replayable content, every playthrough offers new strategies to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b\u200b\u200b<strong>SANDBOX MODE</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want pure destructive freedom? Sandbox mode removes all restrictions, letting you unleash any combination of disasters at will. Create your own scenarios and experiment with different doomsday combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682380/extras/c3d88a1c98d9208ec3317c2a779e35db.poster.avif?t=1759433096\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682380/extras/c3d88a1c98d9208ec3317c2a779e35db.webm?t=1759433096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682380/extras/c3d88a1c98d9208ec3317c2a779e35db.mp4?t=1759433096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><i>\u200b*Number may be lower depending on players' hardware.</i> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2682380?t=1759433096","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2682380?t=1759433096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682380/1c08583495685e2571e99f17e6bf974ec7fccdbe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759433096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682380/1c08583495685e2571e99f17e6bf974ec7fccdbe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759433096","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":2